{"file_name": "store-2-factory.png", "id": "1000345199614941", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624583_1000345202948274_3714007804450407580_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KLX6ioGaViwQ7kNvwGzxCZL&_nc_oc=AdoIjVKr2GXRls4Cn4mf5wXc8m_9Pkx-oJh1tlfd0TfFvYMe6kUxHhGa_vxCjzAtJfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXXvPCmmspa7v8zH0sR1r-RLSEVuxSmlh-kOMkVIF4zMw&oe=6B10669B"}, {"file_name": "store-3-robot-shop.png", "id": "1668313561395617", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628454_1668313564728950_3842695006588611594_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5zz0HEpzfLQQ7kNvwEy7iyh&_nc_oc=AdqJ3ChXhMW1GxDwhmMQFxvFpvWegeby_96TXLSNfM3HmPwRg7H1qeZ5dhwsTCeTjQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUhnByAGDsmH0LEXaKhFldxQgPWr0axCGx1uAljpy0Ndg&oe=6B105DF3"}, {"file_name": "store-4-friends.png", "id": "1631513835420536", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619369_1631513838753869_4313290777978830439_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oohWHlCg2W4Q7kNvwH9BZQf&_nc_oc=AdoESDQtcUr4DQZZLxOESQEOAtn1crjCkW6Ba2KD6wL9ygb14KDZYFd7UUnUJgBcbcE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVCQTGlmDdJ38pRUcRqGGUg0TSD2MWuS_aTcLS470s7mA&oe=6B10671E"}, {"file_name": "store-5-rebuild.png", "id": "1628295938993203", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620630_1628295942326536_5880039889540522475_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IaecjhVnE-IQ7kNvwET0TLX&_nc_oc=AdpBg8CXcFgvIPz4b140vxAShKmSAFl0p6f07Ql1Nh1w1wOAD66jP9Gy9K-mrits8ZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUpcM3tK-bEY7CEknPTDaxYnrntCFEadEQuRMsfbIPFgg&oe=6B1043F1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bonk Slop", "keywords": ["gorilla", "multiplayer", "portals", "robots"], "long_description": "**Move like a gorilla.** No thumbsticks: push off the ground with your hands to run, climb walls and launch yourself through the air.\n\n**Bonk everything.** Punch friends and monsters, grab and throw stuff, ride shopping carts and tear walls off houses.\n\n**A whole world to mess around in**\n- Bonk Town: shops, houses, townsfolk and a bank\n- The Mining Cave: dig ore and gold, sell it at Dave's Shop, buy better gear\n- The Forgotten Factory: four floors of deformed monsters and loot\n- Giant robots, a Titan, and a showdown boss fight\n\n**Portals you can see through.** Become a portal-hopping mad scientist and open seamless portals: look through them, reach your arms in, and walk out somewhere else.\n\n**Play together.** Online rooms for up to five players with public matchmaking or private codes, or play solo.\n\nMade by a solo developer who is learning to code.", "short_description": "Swing your arms to run, climb and fling yourself around as a gorilla in Bonk Slop, a goofy VR brawler. Bonk your friends across town, mine the cave for gold, survive the Forgotten Factory's monsters, pilot giant robots, and hop through real see-through portals as a mad scientist. Play solo or online with up to five players."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dummonk1403.github.io/bonk-slop/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Amazing Gorilla", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/Dummonk1403/bonk-slop/issues", "website_url": "https://dummonk1403.github.io/bonk-slop/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "1983294882347338"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2579583032545599"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2579583032545599"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793399460, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2579583032545599"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2033127697364056", "version": "2.81"}, "id": "2359923834780302", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2033127697364056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- A giant present sits at the top of the main street. Pull its ribbon... if you dare\n- Beat what comes out together: everyone who helped gets 2,500 Bonk Coins and 1 Gold Bonk Coin\n- Snowballs work on him too. Aim for whatever glows\n- Gentler snowfall that glows near warm lights, and snowdrifts around the town and the lake\n- The frozen lake has cracks under the ice, frosty edges and a little more grip\n- Handprints turn with your palm and crunch in the snow\n\nFIXES\n- Gift table: the buttons were hidden behind the board. Now there's a name field, Send, Cancel and a confirm step\n- On-screen keyboards drew their keys under the panel: fixed everywhere", "created_date": 1795836453, "id": "2033127697364056", "version": "2.81", "version_code": 136, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2033127697364056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Winter is here! Snow covers the spawn house, the town and the lake shore\n- The lake is frozen solid: walk out and slide across the ice\n- Warm string lights on the dock and lanterns over the lake\n- Your hands leave prints in the snow\n- Snowballs! Touch the snow and double-tap grip, then throw it or set it down\n- A holiday tree by the spawn house with a present for every player\n- Wrap a present of Gold Bonk Coins for a friend at the gift table\n- Town gorillas wear holiday hats. Knock out a Santa for a surprise", "created_date": 1795816356, "id": "2032928877383938", "version": "2.80", "version_code": 135, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2033127697364056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Beat the Hollow Colossus and your lobby can vote to take on Level 2\n- He comes back angrier... stay out of the black fog if you can\n- A brand new reward waits for whoever finishes Level 2\n- Grab other gorillas by the arm: each arm is its own grab", "created_date": 1795802322, "id": "2032776740732485", "version": "2.79", "version_code": 134, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2033127697364056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "FIXED\n- The ritual countdown no longer skips ahead when a player leaves during it\n- Tower event timing now matches more closely between everyone in the room", "created_date": 1795646284, "id": "2030911707585655", "version": "2.78", "version_code": 133, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2033127697364056"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- A cult tower has risen near spawn: fight up three floors past the Gatekeeper, Malvek and the Maskmaker\n- Break the rooftop ritual device before the 25 second countdown ends... or find out what happens if you don't\n- Something huge is waiting behind the ritual. Beat it together for a big reward", "created_date": 1795630450, "id": "2030742997602526", "version": "2.77", "version_code": 132, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}